#: ../../framework/specs.md:52
msgid "Construction time and use time"
msgstr "生成時点と利用時点"

#: ../../framework/specs.md:54
msgid ""
"`PortSpec`, `DataSpec`, and `ServiceRequirement` are created when a "
"ComponentContract is built and used by the Compiler when connecting the "
"graph. The contract or SearchSpace owns these values; the Runtime does "
"not rewrite them during execution."
msgstr "`PortSpec`、`DataSpec`、`ServiceRequirement`はComponentContractの構築時に作られ、Compilerがグラフ接続時に使います。これらの値は契約またはSearchSpaceが所有し、Runtimeは実行中に書き換えません。"

#: ../../framework/specs.md:57
msgid "Invariants and diagnostics"
msgstr "不変条件と診断"

#: ../../framework/specs.md:59
msgid ""
"An unregistered kind, undefined cardinality, mismatched schema binding, "
"or missing required service becomes a Diagnostic. The implementation "
"reports these with codes such as `unknown_data_spec`, "
"`unknown_cardinality`, `unknown_schema_variable`, and "
"`unresolved_service`."
msgstr ""
"未登録のkind、未定義のcardinality、schema bindingの不一致、要求サービスの不足はDiagnosticsになります。 "
"実装上は`unknown_data_spec`、`unknown_cardinality`、`unknown_schema_variable`、`unresolved_service`などの診断コードで報告されます。"

#: ../../framework/specs.md:62
msgid "Extension points"
msgstr "拡張点"

#: ../../framework/specs.md:64
msgid ""
"When adding a data kind or service, state its registration and "
"compatibility rules explicitly and do not connect it through an implicit "
"type conversion."
msgstr "新しいデータkindやサービスを追加する場合は、登録規則と互換性規則を明示し、暗黙の型変換で接続しない設計にします。"

